      "text": "En Bisaya, 'ngano' se usa para preguntar '¿por qué?', y la respuesta suele comenzar con 'kay', que significa 'porque'. Este patrón es común en las conversaciones diarias.",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 368.749,
      "end": 369.309,
      "kind": "phrase",
      "text": "Ngano?",
      "translation_es": "¿Por qué?",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "tl"
    },
    {
      "start": 371.809,
      "end": 372.809,
      "kind": "phrase",
      "text": "Kay gigutom ko.",
      "translation_es": "Porque tengo hambre.",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "tl"
    },
    {
      "start": 375.309,
      "end": 384.736,
      "kind": "instruction",
      "text": "Ahora, a entender. Vas a oír respuestas típicas, con otra voz. Escucha, y piensa qué significan. Luego te lo digo.",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 385.336,
      "end": 386.802,
      "kind": "phrase",
      "text": "Kay gigutom ko.",
      "translation_es": "Porque tengo hambre.",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "tl"
    },
    {
      "start": 388.802,
      "end": 390.059,
      "kind": "explanation",
      "text": "«Porque tengo hambre».",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 390.559,
      "end": 392.025,
      "kind": "phrase",
      "text": "Kay gigutom ko.",
      "translation_es": "Porque tengo hambre.",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "tl"
    },
    {
      "start": 393.225,
      "end": 399.097,
      "kind": "instruction",
      "text": "Conversación guiada. Yo te digo la situación, tú hablas, y luego lo oyes.",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 399.697,
      "end": 401.886,
      "kind": "prompt",
      "text": "Pregunta a un niño cuándo va a la escuela.",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 405.886,
      "end": 406.526,
      "kind": "phrase",
      "text": "Kanus-a?",
      "translation_es": "¿Cuándo?",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "tl"
    },
    {
      "start": 409.026,
      "end": 411.261,
      "kind": "prompt",
      "text": "Pregunta por qué alguien tiene hambre.",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 415.261,
      "end": 415.821,
      "kind": "phrase",
      "text": "Ngano?",
      "translation_es": "¿Por qué?",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "tl"
    },
    {
      "start": 418.321,
      "end": 421.017,
      "kind": "prompt",
      "text": "Pregunta cuántos sois en su casa.",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 425.017,
      "end": 425.737,
      "kind": "phrase",
      "text": "Pila mo?",
      "translation_es": "¿Cuántos sois?",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "tl"
    },
    {
      "start": 428.237,
      "end": 431.069,
      "kind": "instruction",
      "text": "Repaso final. Todo lo de hoy.",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 431.569,
      "end": 433.056,
      "kind": "prompt",
      "text": "Di: «¿Cuándo?».",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 437.056,
      "end": 437.696,
      "kind": "phrase",
      "text": "Kanus-a?",
      "translation_es": "¿Cuándo?",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "tl"
    },
    {
      "start": 440.196,
      "end": 441.775,
      "kind": "prompt",
      "text": "Otra vez. «¿Por qué?».",
      "translation_es": "",
      "note_es": "",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "start": 445.775,
      "end": 446.335,
